   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {
    "text": ""
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "CONCEPT -> MESH -- TripoSG.  DO NOT USE FOR NOW.\n\nIn this install it returns a cage of fragments instead of the subject,\nwhatever the input: grey or white background, a transparent cut-out,\nsquare framing and the non-flash decoder all fail the same way.\n\nUse img2mesh_trellis instead (MIT, no territory clause, removes the\nbackground itself).\n\n---\n\nDO NOT USE FOR NOW. In this install TripoSG returns a cage of\nfragments filling its bounding cube instead of the subject,\nwhatever the input. Tested 2026-09-10 on one character concept:\na plain grey background, a white background, a transparent RGBA\ncut-out, square framing and use_flash_decoder=false all failed\nthe same way, while img2mesh_trellis.json made a clean mesh from\nthe same image. The weights match Hugging Face byte for byte, so\nthe fault is in the pipeline code or its dependencies, not the\ndownload. Use img2mesh_trellis.json instead: MIT, no territory\nclause, and it removes the background itself. LICENCE: TripoSG\nis MIT upstream, but the copy vendored in this pack ships a\nTencent licence file with the EU, UK and South Korea exclusion;\nsee docs/guide/licensing. SHAPE ONLY: it returns vertex colours,\nnot a texture map."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
